---
description: Accessibility, performance and responsive quality gates.
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.css", "**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Maintain visible keyboard focus states.
- Use semantic headings in logical order.
- Do not encode important text only inside images.
- Optimize images with next/image or an equivalent optimized pipeline.
- Avoid unnecessary client bundles; measure before adding dependencies.
- Test at narrow mobile, standard mobile, laptop and wide desktop widths.
- Check loading states, empty states, long titles, missing images and unusually long event descriptions.
- Prefer progressive enhancement over client-only rendering.
